WEBVTT

00:00:05.620 --> 00:00:07.790
So this is Midgard, huh?

00:00:07.790 --> 00:00:11.500
We're already at our destination, my lady.
Please be cautious.

00:00:11.750 --> 00:00:15.160
Good. Make a note of this, Roskva.

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:21.950
It is also one's duty as a noble
to expose oneself to their subjects.

00:00:24.370 --> 00:00:29.450
Still unseen by anyone

00:00:29.450 --> 00:00:32.330
In the midst of my dreams

00:00:32.330 --> 00:00:40.290
The sweet desire I found is here today as well

00:00:43.290 --> 00:00:48.620
From inside of me

00:00:48.620 --> 00:00:53.500
Someone screams at you to notice

00:00:55.120 --> 00:01:00.330
We stare at one another, at an irritating distance

00:01:00.330 --> 00:01:03.620
Alone, I endure

00:01:03.620 --> 00:01:06.580
The onslaught of sadness

00:01:06.580 --> 00:01:11.500
Though I want to tell you this feeling of love

00:01:12.660 --> 00:01:16.620
I can't say a word

00:01:16.620 --> 00:01:23.370
Though you're always at my side

00:01:23.660 --> 00:01:28.660
Still unseen by anyone

00:01:28.660 --> 00:01:31.700
In the midst of my dreams

00:01:31.700 --> 00:01:35.540
A strong emotion set aflame

00:01:35.540 --> 00:01:41.950
I won't hesitate, I don't want to hesitate

00:01:41.950 --> 00:01:46.950
I'll believe in now, and take a step forward

00:01:47.330 --> 00:01:51.410
For the sake of myself

00:02:02.830 --> 00:02:06.910
Will you go to the city after school
and get some sewing tools for me?

00:02:07.750 --> 00:02:13.750
Good grief! Big Sister Misa and the others would be
completely hopeless without me! Seriously!

00:02:14.410 --> 00:02:17.410
At any rate... this is a train, huh?

00:02:17.750 --> 00:02:20.330
It's just as packed as I heard it would be.

00:02:21.160 --> 00:02:25.450
I want to hurry home and treat myself
to a mikan under the kotatsu.

00:02:28.950 --> 00:02:30.790
C-could this be...

00:02:30.790 --> 00:02:33.450
what they call a "groper"?!

00:02:34.830 --> 00:02:37.830
The fiendish enemy of maidens, akin to an akuma!

00:02:37.830 --> 00:02:41.000
Trying his hand against a Valkyrie has sealed his fate!

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:42.830
I will capture him!

00:02:43.790 --> 00:02:45.910
W-wait, Itsuyo! It's me!

00:02:47.080 --> 00:02:50.250
Natsuki? Wh-what in the world are you doing?

00:02:50.250 --> 00:02:51.450
What do you mean?

00:02:51.450 --> 00:02:56.000
Didn't Misa-san ask you to do Val Love,
"Protect a Maiden from a Groper"?

00:02:57.250 --> 00:03:00.750
You're gonna do a Val Love with Itsuyo, okay?

00:03:00.750 --> 00:03:02.330
You'll be the groper.

00:03:02.330 --> 00:03:03.830
I guess I have to.

00:03:03.830 --> 00:03:05.450
I agree to go shopping!

00:03:05.790 --> 00:03:10.290
I was so happy that I to be given a task by
Big Sister Misa I completely forgot! How dumb!

00:03:11.080 --> 00:03:12.750
Exactly what I wanted!

00:03:12.750 --> 00:03:15.330
Now then, come on and grope me!

00:03:15.330 --> 00:03:17.450
Shh! You're too loud!

00:03:18.080 --> 00:03:22.660
When the train gets to the station,
I push Natsuki-san aside and rescue Itsuyo-san!

00:03:22.660 --> 00:03:26.000
Push Natsuki-san aside and save Itsuyo-san!

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:26.910
Okay!

00:03:27.250 --> 00:03:30.410
Excuse me, can I have a word with you?

00:03:30.410 --> 00:03:32.410
Huh?! I-I'm...

00:03:32.410 --> 00:03:34.750
The suspicious person is in custody, over.

00:03:34.750 --> 00:03:37.870
Will you come with me to the station staff office?

00:03:38.080 --> 00:03:40.870
C-crap!

00:03:46.660 --> 00:03:49.080
Okay, we're going to start again.

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:50.500
G-got it!

00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:51.580
Val Love

00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:52.580
Val Love, commence.

00:03:51.790 --> 00:03:52.580
Commence

00:03:55.410 --> 00:03:59.660
In any case, this pressure is intense.

00:04:00.660 --> 00:04:05.080
They were about the same size when we were younger,
so why is there such a big difference now?

00:04:05.080 --> 00:04:07.660
We grew up under the
same circumstances and everything!

00:04:07.660 --> 00:04:10.870
N-Natsuki! You're focusing too much on my chest!

00:04:10.870 --> 00:04:12.330
S-sorry.

00:04:14.500 --> 00:04:16.910
This is to become the strongest of the Valkyries!

00:04:17.080 --> 00:04:21.000
This is to become the strongest of the Valkyries!

00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:24.250
The train will sway up ahead, so please be careful.

00:04:27.750 --> 00:04:30.870
N-Natsuki? That place is very...

00:04:30.870 --> 00:04:33.700
I told you, you're concentrating
too much on my boobs!

00:04:34.200 --> 00:04:36.120
Natsuki! Are you listening to me?

00:04:36.120 --> 00:04:38.290
What a gorgeous body...

00:04:38.290 --> 00:04:41.580
This must be the ideal maiden "boi-oi-oing"!

00:04:42.040 --> 00:04:43.200
Here too!

00:04:43.450 --> 00:04:44.660
And here!

00:04:46.620 --> 00:04:51.160
We're almost at our destination!
I just have to tolerate this a bit longer...

00:04:55.870 --> 00:05:00.120
Due to discovery of a suspicious person in the station,
train operation has been interrupted.

00:05:00.410 --> 00:05:03.540
We apologize for the trouble,
but please stay put for the time being.

00:05:03.540 --> 00:05:04.830
A suspicious person?!

00:05:04.830 --> 00:05:08.000
Who in the world would do something
at a time like this?

00:05:10.410 --> 00:05:13.330
I can't believe this is still happening.

00:05:13.620 --> 00:05:16.700
Hurry, hurry and get to the station!

00:05:19.830 --> 00:05:23.450
I-I'm glad I could somehow clear up
this misunderstanding.

00:05:23.450 --> 00:05:28.000
Looks like the train isn't here yet,
so I'll just catch my breath for now.

00:05:28.410 --> 00:05:31.750
The train on track two will arrive momentarily.

00:05:31.750 --> 00:05:34.370
Please stand inside the yellow line.

00:05:35.750 --> 00:05:39.660
It's here! Push Natsuki-san aside
and save Itsuyo-san!

00:05:39.830 --> 00:05:43.250
Push Natsuki-san aside and save Itsuyo-san!

00:05:43.540 --> 00:05:44.540
Now!

00:05:47.410 --> 00:05:50.580
C-crap! The exit's on the other side!

00:05:48.830 --> 00:05:50.580
T
This side
will open
I
N

00:05:51.200 --> 00:05:53.540
I-it's so horrifically packed in here.

00:05:53.540 --> 00:05:58.620
My internal human sensor
can't move past this and it's going off...

00:05:58.620 --> 00:06:01.410
But, I'm going in!

00:06:01.410 --> 00:06:03.040
E-excuse me!

00:06:03.790 --> 00:06:05.000
Found 'em!

00:06:05.000 --> 00:06:07.500
G-groper, eradicated!

00:06:08.620 --> 00:06:12.370
Val Love, "Protect a Maiden from
a Groper," accomplished.

00:06:08.790 --> 00:06:09.290
Val Love

00:06:09.540 --> 00:06:11.250
Protect a Maiden from a Groper

00:06:11.540 --> 00:06:12.750
Accomplished

00:06:13.000 --> 00:06:16.290
We did it, Itsuyo! The Val Love was successful!

00:06:16.660 --> 00:06:19.000
Y-you did a great job!

00:06:24.750 --> 00:06:29.450
Dash

00:06:24.950 --> 00:06:27.950
Everyone's too handsy with my boobs!

00:06:33.620 --> 00:06:36.910
Flounder's cheap today! Super cheap!

00:06:37.160 --> 00:06:39.370
Good evening, sir!

00:06:39.370 --> 00:06:42.410
Oh, Taka-chan. What'll it be today?

00:06:42.870 --> 00:06:46.450
Let's see... Can I have three herring, please?

00:06:47.000 --> 00:06:48.910
Here, this one's on me, too.

00:06:48.910 --> 00:06:50.330
Huh? Are you sure?

00:06:50.330 --> 00:06:54.870
The two of you brothers living huddled together
is enough to make me wanna cry!

00:06:54.870 --> 00:06:56.330
Don't worry about it!

00:06:56.330 --> 00:06:58.580
Thanks, sir!

00:06:59.450 --> 00:07:02.120
Oh my, Taka-chan, on your way home from school?

00:07:02.120 --> 00:07:02.910
Yes.

00:07:02.910 --> 00:07:04.450
Taka-chan, good evening!

00:07:04.450 --> 00:07:06.660
Good evening, flower shop lady!

00:07:06.950 --> 00:07:10.660
Taka-chan, would you like to
come over for dinner tonight?

00:07:10.660 --> 00:07:12.450
I've made too much...

00:07:13.750 --> 00:07:16.580
I'm sorry, I'll have to pass this time.

00:07:16.580 --> 00:07:20.950
Today, a friend of mine is coming over to play!

00:07:26.290 --> 00:07:28.200
Big Brother, I'm home.

00:07:33.620 --> 00:07:35.000
Good grief.

00:07:35.330 --> 00:07:37.250
Tore your collar off, eh?

00:07:37.620 --> 00:07:41.120
You'll be punished again later, Big Brother.

00:07:43.160 --> 00:07:45.750
I haven't eaten anything in three days.

00:07:45.750 --> 00:07:47.410
I'm starving.

00:07:47.410 --> 00:07:49.250
Let me eat something.

00:07:49.410 --> 00:07:50.500
No.

00:07:51.040 --> 00:07:54.790
More importantly, I bought some ingredients
so I need you to cook.

00:07:55.290 --> 00:07:58.160
We must prepare our welcome for Our Lady.

00:07:58.500 --> 00:08:01.620
You're outta your damn mind!
Why the hell do I have to...

00:08:03.450 --> 00:08:05.870
Yes, sir! I'll get right on it!

00:08:06.160 --> 00:08:09.080
By the way, would it be alright if I had
a few nibbles of something?

00:08:09.080 --> 00:08:11.040
I'm feeling a bit hungry...

00:08:11.040 --> 00:08:12.080
No.

00:08:12.080 --> 00:08:14.040
You got it!

00:08:14.450 --> 00:08:16.250
Herring simmered in soy sauce...

00:08:16.250 --> 00:08:18.450
Put it all backwards and what do you get?

00:08:18.450 --> 00:08:19.830
Something different!

00:08:20.500 --> 00:08:24.250
Now then, Our Lady loves sweets.

00:08:24.450 --> 00:08:26.580
It's simple, but dessert will be...

00:08:27.870 --> 00:08:28.910
Great.

00:08:38.450 --> 00:08:42.700
This is pretty good, these dumplings or whatever.

00:08:42.700 --> 00:08:44.450
We are satisfied.

00:08:45.370 --> 00:08:47.080
It is Our Lady!

00:08:47.450 --> 00:08:50.830
Oh, Our Lady, what a sight for sore eyes you arf!

00:08:50.830 --> 00:08:53.750
Did you like to eat spicy foods?

00:08:57.000 --> 00:09:00.410
Garm-sama, take it easy with the joking.

00:09:00.580 --> 00:09:02.290
I will slaughter you.

00:09:02.290 --> 00:09:03.620
Stop that.

00:09:03.620 --> 00:09:04.620
Yes, ma'am.

00:09:05.200 --> 00:09:08.910
We were given two imperial commands
from the duke:

00:09:08.910 --> 00:09:12.580
Destroy the Valkyries, and acquire the Misteltein.

00:09:12.580 --> 00:09:14.870
Everything else is trivial.

00:09:15.160 --> 00:09:17.370
Take a note, Roskva.

00:09:17.700 --> 00:09:18.830
Yes, ma'am.

00:09:18.830 --> 00:09:22.450
The sweets of Midgard are quite tasty.

00:09:22.450 --> 00:09:25.330
"Proverbs of Our Lady"

00:09:22.870 --> 00:09:25.000
They are quite tasty... okay.

00:09:26.870 --> 00:09:30.250
What a nice place Midgard is.

00:09:30.250 --> 00:09:33.330
I, Skuld, will unquestionably fulfill
the imperial commands,

00:09:33.330 --> 00:09:35.580
guide us toward the victory at Ragnarok,

00:09:33.870 --> 00:09:38.830
The Third Norn
"Skuld"
Egg Lv. 52

00:09:35.580 --> 00:09:38.250
so just try save this world!

00:09:38.950 --> 00:09:42.750
Things are getting perilous aren't they, Valkyries?!

00:09:45.120 --> 00:09:46.540
Is something wrong?

00:09:46.540 --> 00:09:49.000
No, I just got a chill.

00:09:50.790 --> 00:09:54.080
Anyways, have you been able to
summon that book at will yet?

00:09:54.080 --> 00:09:56.540
N-no. I'm sorry.

00:09:57.620 --> 00:10:00.200
Well, you are a normal human,

00:10:00.200 --> 00:10:02.580
so there's likely a large degree of
inconsistency for your abilities.

00:10:03.040 --> 00:10:06.620
By the way, Takuma, what is that you have there?

00:10:07.000 --> 00:10:09.290
It's a study book.

00:10:09.290 --> 00:10:11.200
There's a mock exam coming up.

00:10:11.620 --> 00:10:13.120
I forgot about that!

00:10:13.120 --> 00:10:18.750
Not to be rude, but Natsuki-san,
I think you should study harder.

00:10:18.750 --> 00:10:20.750
I-I know that.

00:10:20.750 --> 00:10:24.120
Look! I even got new glasses the other day!

00:10:24.120 --> 00:10:25.120
Oh...

00:10:25.120 --> 00:10:28.870
When I put these on,
my grades should improve in no time!

00:10:28.870 --> 00:10:31.000
See? Look! How's this?!

00:10:31.000 --> 00:10:32.080
Um.

00:10:38.330 --> 00:10:41.660
I'm freezing... Did I catch a cold?

00:10:47.790 --> 00:10:49.500
Wh-wh-wha...

00:10:50.250 --> 00:10:56.620
Er, well... You looked cold, so I thought
if I held your hand it might warm you up.

00:10:57.200 --> 00:11:01.410
E-even so, it's shocking to have someone
suddenly grab your hand, right?!

00:11:01.410 --> 00:11:03.910
You could have given me a jacket or something!

00:11:03.910 --> 00:11:05.290
I-I'm sorry!

00:11:08.540 --> 00:11:09.660
But...

00:11:12.200 --> 00:11:15.700
I feel very warm. Thanks.

00:11:23.080 --> 00:11:24.660
Natsuki-san?

00:11:25.620 --> 00:11:27.450
There's something here!

00:11:27.450 --> 00:11:30.540
It was just a moment... but I'm sure I felt it.

00:11:30.830 --> 00:11:34.080
A feeling of bloodlust like a spear
that pierces even the darkness!

00:11:35.200 --> 00:11:38.410
Is this a new type of akuma?
A vanguard of the malevolent gods?!

00:11:38.620 --> 00:11:42.370
Could they have made it this far
without being sensed by the aether stream?!

00:11:42.700 --> 00:11:43.830
Um...

00:11:43.830 --> 00:11:45.000
Stay back!

00:11:54.540 --> 00:11:55.580
Natsuki-san!

00:11:55.580 --> 00:11:56.410
Stay back!

00:12:00.620 --> 00:12:03.160
My arms are so numb I can't move them.

00:12:03.160 --> 00:12:05.160
I've still got a ways to go until I'm home...

00:12:05.160 --> 00:12:06.410
What do I do?

00:12:06.410 --> 00:12:09.750
This is happening when I can't transform, of all days!

00:12:09.910 --> 00:12:12.450
At this rate, I'll die...

00:12:13.370 --> 00:12:14.700
Ten seconds.

00:12:18.500 --> 00:12:22.120
I can't believe you handled my lunges
in ten seconds flat.

00:12:22.120 --> 00:12:24.450
You've improved, Natsuki.

00:12:25.080 --> 00:12:26.580
That voice...

00:12:33.540 --> 00:12:36.750
Exactly what I'd expect from my little sister!

00:12:34.290 --> 00:12:38.040
Ichika Saotome
"Brunhilde"
"Spear" Lv. 1

00:12:38.620 --> 00:12:41.160
Good grief, I can't stand guys like you...

00:12:42.290 --> 00:12:45.000
It's pathetic that you're always
being protected by Natsuki!

00:12:45.000 --> 00:12:46.790
Shame on you, Lover!

00:12:46.790 --> 00:12:49.540
wobble
shake
wobble
shake

00:12:47.250 --> 00:12:49.540
Er, well...

00:12:49.540 --> 00:12:50.950
I'm sorry.

00:12:50.620 --> 00:12:51.830
Defeat

00:12:51.950 --> 00:12:54.540
C-Captain, it's not that bad...

00:12:54.540 --> 00:12:56.540
Natsuki, you have to fall back!

00:12:56.540 --> 00:13:00.660
Er, um... It's nice to meet you, elder sister.

00:13:00.830 --> 00:13:02.540
This is NOT the first time I've met you!

00:13:02.540 --> 00:13:05.000
I've been guarding your ass this entire time.

00:13:05.000 --> 00:13:08.410
At that time, and at that time, and that time too!

00:13:09.000 --> 00:13:15.160
My beloved sisters are with a weakling like this,
and going on d-d-d-dates?!

00:13:17.750 --> 00:13:20.830
It's too late to change Einheijer at this point.

00:13:20.830 --> 00:13:23.120
But here's something to keep in mind, Lover:

00:13:23.580 --> 00:13:26.200
Next time, just try to make one foul move.

00:13:26.200 --> 00:13:29.410
When that happens,
you'll be gored to death within a second!

00:13:32.120 --> 00:13:33.370
What?

00:13:33.620 --> 00:13:35.910
You're back, Big Sis Ichika?

00:13:36.040 --> 00:13:38.410
Wow! It's Big Sister Ichika!

00:13:41.450 --> 00:13:44.500
It's been so long, my beloved sisters!

00:13:44.500 --> 00:13:45.910
I missed you all!

00:13:45.910 --> 00:13:48.870
Big Sister, you're just as little as you always are!

00:13:48.870 --> 00:13:51.290
And you get bigger every time we meet, Kururi!

00:13:51.620 --> 00:13:54.790
Big Sister Ichika, I baked cookies.
Would you like some?

00:13:54.790 --> 00:13:56.250
Of course I'd like some!

00:13:56.250 --> 00:13:58.250
Wobble

00:13:56.250 --> 00:13:58.250
I should go to the bathroom while I can...

00:14:00.700 --> 00:14:02.660
Where are you off to, Lover?

00:14:02.660 --> 00:14:04.870
I'm not done speaking with you.

00:14:04.870 --> 00:14:07.580
I'm behind her, how could she tell?!

00:14:07.580 --> 00:14:09.870
Calm down, Ichika...

00:14:10.040 --> 00:14:11.540
Here you go, Sis.

00:14:13.160 --> 00:14:16.450
Delicious! As expected from my little sister!

00:14:17.200 --> 00:14:19.290
The time has finally come.

00:14:19.290 --> 00:14:20.700
Big Sister Futaba!

00:14:20.700 --> 00:14:23.660
Big Sister Futaba cleaned the bath for us!

00:14:23.870 --> 00:14:28.580
Big Sister Ichika is here to take
the offensive role in place of Natsuki-chan.

00:14:29.080 --> 00:14:31.000
I'm sorry, Captain.

00:14:31.000 --> 00:14:33.000
Don't worry about it, dear sister!

00:14:33.000 --> 00:14:38.660
Big Sister Ichika is still level one,
so you have to work hard, Takuma-chan.

00:14:39.160 --> 00:14:43.290
Now then, let's get started with... Val Love:

00:14:44.160 --> 00:14:46.410
"Scrub Each Other Down in the Bath!"

00:14:49.040 --> 00:14:54.040
Throb
Throb

00:14:51.250 --> 00:14:54.040
This is even more pressure than with Natsuki-san.

00:14:56.290 --> 00:14:58.870
Why are you so hesitant all of a sudden?

00:14:58.870 --> 00:15:03.290
Were you seriously thinking that you're a man
who is worthy of being recognized as one?

00:15:03.290 --> 00:15:06.750
You need to re-evaluate yourself, weakling.

00:15:06.750 --> 00:15:07.870
I'm sorry.

00:15:08.540 --> 00:15:10.830
I heard something from Futaba, Lover.

00:15:10.830 --> 00:15:13.790
She says you can't efficiently handle your abilities.

00:15:13.790 --> 00:15:16.250
Come on, try to call forth that book.

00:15:16.250 --> 00:15:18.080
Huh? O-okay.

00:15:18.910 --> 00:15:21.500
Ability... invoke!

00:15:28.540 --> 00:15:31.830
I... I'm sorry. I really can't seem to do it.

00:15:31.830 --> 00:15:33.660
You, Lover...

00:15:33.950 --> 00:15:36.450
What do you think about my sisters?

00:15:36.450 --> 00:15:38.370
Wh-why this all of a sudden?

00:15:38.370 --> 00:15:40.910
Just answer the question you've been asked!

00:15:41.910 --> 00:15:44.370
You surely don't mean to say
that you hate them or something...

00:15:44.370 --> 00:15:46.120
I-I-I would never!

00:15:46.700 --> 00:15:48.620
I'm grateful to them.

00:15:48.620 --> 00:15:53.250
Though this is to save the world,
they still keep me company.

00:15:53.250 --> 00:15:57.950
Having me as their partner must be tough,
so I'm sorry about that.

00:15:58.410 --> 00:16:00.870
That was a pathetic answer.

00:16:00.870 --> 00:16:03.500
This must be why you can't efficiently use your ability.

00:16:03.500 --> 00:16:04.450
Huh?

00:16:04.950 --> 00:16:07.330
You're Einheijer, aren't you?

00:16:07.330 --> 00:16:10.790
It's highly unlikely that a lover
can become stronger without falling in love.

00:16:10.790 --> 00:16:14.950
What you feel toward my sisters
isn't love; it's obligation!

00:16:14.950 --> 00:16:18.200
Though there are nine sacred swords
in your possession,

00:16:18.200 --> 00:16:21.500
you can only handle two at once,
and that's why.

00:16:21.660 --> 00:16:25.500
When the maidens and their lover
feel the same, they become stronger.

00:16:25.500 --> 00:16:30.790
Therefore, while you remain weak it's difficult for
the maidens to get stronger than they are now.

00:16:30.790 --> 00:16:33.620
It's impossible to change the lover at this point!

00:16:33.620 --> 00:16:38.370
At the very least, try to become a man
that can make me fall for you, Lover!

00:16:40.580 --> 00:16:41.580
Respond.

00:16:41.580 --> 00:16:42.790
O-okay!

00:16:45.040 --> 00:16:46.410
Excuse us...

00:16:46.410 --> 00:16:48.870
Oh, what is it, my sisters?

00:16:48.870 --> 00:16:51.040
Futaba asked us to do something...

00:16:51.410 --> 00:16:56.870
It may get heavy in there with just the two of them,
so try to keep the mood nice.

00:16:57.450 --> 00:17:00.700
I just wanted to get in the bath early.

00:17:01.410 --> 00:17:02.410
Huh?

00:17:05.500 --> 00:17:07.410
What?!

00:17:07.660 --> 00:17:09.750
D-don't stare at me, dummy!

00:17:09.750 --> 00:17:11.200
I-I-I'm sorry!

00:17:11.200 --> 00:17:13.370
Were you staring at her, bastard?!

00:17:13.370 --> 00:17:14.660
I'b shorry!

00:17:15.830 --> 00:17:18.200
W-well, I'm going to start now.

00:17:21.580 --> 00:17:23.370
Hey, hey, Big Sis Misa.

00:17:23.370 --> 00:17:24.330
Hmm?

00:17:24.330 --> 00:17:27.290
Is Big Sis Ichika really that strong?

00:17:27.290 --> 00:17:31.700
Oh right, you've never seen Ichika fight, have you?

00:17:31.700 --> 00:17:37.000
Big Sister Ichika has a Seidr,
just like Yakumo-chan and Shino-chan.

00:17:37.790 --> 00:17:42.540
A Seidr where in exchange for their mighty power,
they have abnormal conditions.

00:17:42.870 --> 00:17:45.910
Though Big Sister Ichika's a demigoddess,

00:17:45.910 --> 00:17:49.000
she may be capable of competing on
the same level as the high-ranking gods.

00:17:49.540 --> 00:17:51.160
Abnormal conditions?

00:17:51.160 --> 00:17:56.160
Yeah. Yakumo has hypersensitive hearing,
but in Ichika's case,

00:17:56.160 --> 00:17:58.040
it's extremely sensitive skin.

00:18:01.500 --> 00:18:04.700
Big Sister Ichika's skin feels things very easily.

00:18:07.120 --> 00:18:10.080
She can sense the position of the enemy
through the sensations on her skin.

00:18:10.080 --> 00:18:13.250
Even at level one she can
completely defeat the enemies.

00:18:13.790 --> 00:18:17.450
She was very reliable on the Valhalla defense mission.

00:18:17.790 --> 00:18:20.160
She was so amazing then!

00:18:20.450 --> 00:18:22.540
Then with her sensitive skin...

00:18:22.540 --> 00:18:26.620
is it okay if she and Big Brother
are washing each other?

00:18:27.700 --> 00:18:30.410
Well, Natsuki is with them so it'll be fine, right?

00:18:30.870 --> 00:18:32.910
Kururi-chan, do you want some snacks?

00:18:32.910 --> 00:18:33.910
Gimme!

00:18:34.200 --> 00:18:36.500
It's so warm under here...

00:18:36.700 --> 00:18:37.830
Endure...

00:18:37.830 --> 00:18:39.250
I must endure!

00:18:40.580 --> 00:18:42.950
Don't wither under the sensations of the Lover...

00:18:43.200 --> 00:18:46.660
I have to... keep feeling it!

00:18:51.790 --> 00:18:54.450
U-um, are you okay?

00:18:55.370 --> 00:18:58.250
I will not be taken down by the likes of you!

00:18:58.250 --> 00:18:59.450
What?!

00:19:01.750 --> 00:19:03.870
It's my turn next.

00:19:04.580 --> 00:19:07.200
I think I'm experiencing déjà vu or something.

00:19:07.200 --> 00:19:09.700
I hope we can finish this with no incident.

00:19:15.250 --> 00:19:16.870
An incident!

00:19:18.700 --> 00:19:19.870
Err...

00:19:19.870 --> 00:19:22.500
Wh-what is it, Lover?!

00:19:22.830 --> 00:19:24.750
What are you doing right now?

00:19:24.750 --> 00:19:30.200
What do you mean? I heard this is
the traditional way to bathe in Midgard!

00:19:30.200 --> 00:19:31.500
Yakumo told me!

00:19:31.500 --> 00:19:33.040
Yakumo-san?!

00:19:33.330 --> 00:19:37.290
I can't believe I'm doing something so disgraceful!

00:19:37.290 --> 00:19:40.080
And for such a weakling...

00:19:41.000 --> 00:19:44.830
Every time I rub on him, I feel like I'll pass out.

00:19:45.200 --> 00:19:46.250
But...

00:19:46.540 --> 00:19:49.080
I haven't lost yet!

00:19:51.250 --> 00:19:53.120
...ki... tsuki...

00:19:53.120 --> 00:19:54.200
Natsuki...

00:19:54.200 --> 00:19:55.290
Wha?!

00:19:55.290 --> 00:19:57.620
You've been so fidgety, what's wrong?

00:19:57.870 --> 00:19:59.790
N-nothing's wrong!

00:19:59.790 --> 00:20:03.370
I thought you might want to do
a scrub down with Big Brother too.

00:20:03.830 --> 00:20:05.700
Th-that isn't...

00:20:07.450 --> 00:20:10.040
Wh-what are you doing all of a sudden?!

00:20:11.540 --> 00:20:15.120
I just kinda wanted... to tease you a bit.

00:20:15.120 --> 00:20:16.540
You're so blunt!

00:20:19.000 --> 00:20:22.200
You like Big Brother, right?

00:20:23.120 --> 00:20:26.080
Wh-wh-who would would like someone so shameless?

00:20:26.330 --> 00:20:29.040
It's okay to admit it, you know.

00:20:29.750 --> 00:20:35.000
If a maiden is emotionally involved with her lover,
it's easier to accumulate experience points,

00:20:35.000 --> 00:20:37.330
and everything is smooth sailing from there.

00:20:37.830 --> 00:20:40.250
You should go ahead and confess to him.

00:20:41.040 --> 00:20:45.450
If he feels the same about you,
he might touch you more.

00:20:45.910 --> 00:20:48.370
Perhaps your cute boobies.

00:20:48.790 --> 00:20:51.750
Wh-whoa, Yakumo! Cut it out!

00:20:52.580 --> 00:20:56.120
It's true, I love your voice most of all...

00:20:57.910 --> 00:21:00.250
H-hey! That's not a good...

00:21:02.950 --> 00:21:05.330
S-stop doing this!

00:21:08.250 --> 00:21:09.450
Ow...

00:21:10.410 --> 00:21:11.450
Whoa.

00:21:13.410 --> 00:21:15.330
Kiss with Lover, confirmed.

00:21:13.500 --> 00:21:14.250
Kiss with Lover

00:21:14.540 --> 00:21:15.540
Confirmed

00:21:15.830 --> 00:21:17.790
Valkyrie Invoked

00:21:15.830 --> 00:21:17.330
Invoking Valkyrie...

00:21:21.410 --> 00:21:22.370
The First Valkyrie
"Brunhilde"
"Spear" Lv. 1

00:21:23.660 --> 00:21:27.160
Make one foul move,
and you'll be dead in a second.

00:21:28.410 --> 00:21:30.200
I-I'm sorry!

00:21:30.200 --> 00:21:32.540
What just happened was an accident-

00:21:36.040 --> 00:21:39.410
Even at level one the Captain is ridiculously strong,

00:21:39.410 --> 00:21:41.750
but her AP is extremely low.

00:21:41.750 --> 00:21:46.580
In other words, I guess you could say
she has bad energy efficiency, or...well...

00:21:46.950 --> 00:21:51.080
Since she's level one, even when she transforms
she's unable to move for even a second.

00:21:51.080 --> 00:21:52.620
Uh...

00:21:54.370 --> 00:21:57.290
Don't you think you've won this, Lover.

00:21:57.540 --> 00:22:00.910
This is nothing more than the prologue
to a long-lasting battle!

00:22:00.910 --> 00:22:04.540
Know that it is the one standing in the end
who is the true victor!

00:22:04.950 --> 00:22:08.540
C-Captain, I'll turn you face up for now, okay?

00:22:09.540 --> 00:22:13.370
Thank you, Natsuki.
As expected of my little sister!

00:22:13.370 --> 00:22:15.370
I can't breathe like this.

00:22:15.370 --> 00:22:18.620
I seriously went too far.

00:22:18.620 --> 00:22:19.620
Sorry.

00:22:19.620 --> 00:22:21.950
It's totally okay so don't worry, Yakumo!

00:22:23.200 --> 00:22:25.950
I wonder what love is...

00:22:27.370 --> 00:22:31.200
Val Love, "Scrub Each Other Down
in the Bath," accomplished.

00:22:33.120 --> 00:22:36.500
Our Lady. Will you please say that once more?

00:22:36.750 --> 00:22:40.120
Very well. Take a note, Roskva.

00:22:40.120 --> 00:22:41.250
Yes, ma'am.

00:22:41.700 --> 00:22:46.580
Listening to the needs of the subjects
is also the duty of a ruler, after all.

00:22:46.580 --> 00:22:48.540
"After all"... okay.

00:22:49.370 --> 00:22:52.370
We once more declare:

00:22:57.950 --> 00:23:01.370
From here, we will infiltrate the enemy fortress,

00:23:02.000 --> 00:23:05.330
and kill Einheijer in a single blow!

00:23:06.540 --> 00:23:08.290
What is it, you bastard?

00:23:08.290 --> 00:23:11.700
You surely don't think you've won
on such a trivial matter, do you?!

00:23:11.700 --> 00:23:13.200
N-no.

00:23:13.200 --> 00:23:18.330
Uh... having super sensitive skin
seems like it'd be rough in daily life.

00:23:19.000 --> 00:23:21.620
That's a worthless opinion typical of a weakling.

00:23:21.950 --> 00:23:26.120
My super sensitive skin is instrumental
precisely because I'm on the battlefield.

00:23:26.120 --> 00:23:28.660
I sense even the slightest move of the enemy!

00:23:28.660 --> 00:23:30.160
I-I see.

00:23:30.160 --> 00:23:33.910
That means you can throw your spear
precisely without even looking, right?

00:23:33.910 --> 00:23:37.660
If you make one foul move,
this spear will pass through you in a second!

00:23:37.660 --> 00:23:38.790
Eek!

00:23:38.790 --> 00:23:41.080
Next time, "The Drunken Maiden."
